[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Investigation Timeline
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:11:42 UTC**: Attacker at `198.51.100.167` initiates malicious file upload attempt (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:391`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:12:05 UTC**: Attacker attempts JNDI/LDAP lookup via parameter manipulation (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:392`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:13:49 UTC**: Attacker probes Apache Struts showcase endpoint using OGNL injection payload (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:393`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:13:50 UTC**: Web shell `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` successfully planted (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`, `/sas/alerts.json:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:20:00 UTC**: Attacker executes shell commands via web shell (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:14`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:25:00 UTC**: Sensitive database dump staged for exfiltration at `/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz` (`/disk/tmp/.cache/dump.tar.gz:2`, `/sas/alerts.json:8`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:32:30 UTC**: Staged archive exfiltrated over HTTPS POST to `198.51.100.167` (`/disk/var/log/tomcat/access-exfil.log:116`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:35:00 UTC**: SSH public key backdoor planted in `/root/.ssh/authorized_keys` (`/disk/root/.ssh/authorized_keys:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:40:00 UTC**: Cron persistence established in `/var/spool/cron/tomcat` fetching beacon script (`/disk/var/spool/cron/tomcat:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:14`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-08 03:45:00 UTC**: Attacker selectively wipes system authentication logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).
