[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Web Shell Isolation (Backup & Quarantine)**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - **Action**: Move `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:2`) into quarantine directory `/opt/quarantine/`.
