[?2004l[?2004h>    - **Verification**: Verify new JAR version in `/opt/tomcat/lib/` and run vulnerability scan (`/sas/vulns.json:3`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Web Server Security Hardening**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - **Action**: Disable dynamic script execution in `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/` directory (`/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - **Verification**: Test uploading dynamic test file; confirm web server returns HTTP 403 / 404.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 4: Post-Incident Hardening & Monitoring (Long-term)
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Centralized Log Forwarding**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - **Action**: Configure syslog-ng / rsyslog / SIEM log shipping for `/var/log/secure` and system logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).
